<title>USA: St Joseph hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00</p>
<p>higher compared to Monday. Top $55.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    55.00-55.50</p>
<p>US 2-3	270-290 lbs    52.50-54.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Steady to 1.00 lower. Top 51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3	300-550 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>		550-700 lbs    51.00</p>
</text>
